  <data name="About_ComponentsList" xml:space="preserve">

    <value>FFmpeg / FFmpegInteropX (demuxing and decoding HEVC, AC-3, etc.)

Windows App SDK (WinUI 3), .NET 8, CommunityToolkit

Serilog (logging), Inno Setup (installer)</value>

  </data>

  <data name="About_FeaturesList" xml:space="preserve">

    <value>• Live streams and catch-up archives with seeking

• Video library (portal): films, series, quality selection

• XMLTV programme guide, programme reminders

• Channel/programme recording (ffmpeg, up to 3 parallel)

• Favorites, history, previous channel (Backspace)

• Mini player (Ctrl+M), stream stats (Ctrl+J)

• Semi-automatic updates (GitHub Releases)

• Parental control, dark theme, Russian/English</value>

  </data>

